graph TD
    %% Initial Acquisition
    Start([Start SDK]) --> Signin{Signin Method}
    Signin -- Credentials --> LoginAPI[GET /authentication/v1.0/login]
    Signin -- Provided Token --> SetToken[Store Token in RESTService.tokenRest]

    LoginAPI -->|Success| StoreToken[Store Token in RESTService.tokenRest]
    StoreToken --> InitServices[Initialize Services & XMPP]
    SetToken --> InitServices

    %% Token Survey & Renewal
    InitServices --> StartSurvey[Start Token Survey]
    StartSurvey --> DecodeJWT[Decode JWT to find Expiration 'exp']
    DecodeJWT --> CalcDelay[Calculate Renewal Delay - Usually 5 mins before exp or 1/2 duration]
    CalcDelay --> SetTimer[Set Timer: renewTokenInterval]

    SetTimer --> TimerWait{Timer Expired?}
    TimerWait -- Yes --> RenewToken[GET /authentication/v1.0/renew]
    RenewToken -->|Success: New Token| UpdateToken[Update tokenRest]
    UpdateToken --> StartSurvey

    RenewToken -->|Failure| TokenExpired[Emit evt_internal_tokenexpired]
    TokenExpired --> StopSDK([Stop SDK / Reconnect Required])
    StopSDK -- Reconnect --> Start

    %% Usage
    subgraph REST API Calls
        Request[App REST Request] --> GetHeader[Get Auth Header: Bearer tokenRest]
        GetHeader --> SendRequest[Send Request to Rainbow Server]
    end

    %% Termination
    Stop([Stop SDK / Signout]) --> SignoutAPI[GET /authentication/v1.0/logout]
    SignoutAPI --> ClearToken[Clear tokenRest & renewTokenInterval]
    ClearToken --> End([End])